Z||000008||GTDude||12-12-2001||11:36 AM||||Ok, then you are talking about the cruise servo.....you just mistated where it was located.  After you find what is smoking it you can buy a rebuilt one for about 60.00 from NAPA, Carquest or some other parts store.  <P>Now fill me in about the blown fuse, lamps not working, radio light, etc.  Tell me all the details that your originally posted cause I have no idea where this all started.<P>I'm a GM auto tech with all the shop manuals and I specialize in electrical problems.  Glad to help if you fill me in.<P><P>------------------<BR>GTDude's 86GT||||reg||3
